## Nice tables with [{gt}](https://gt.rstudio.com) {.inv}

Markdown tables are plain; [{gt}](https://gt.rstudio.com) turns a data frame into a *styled, captioned report table*:

::: {.codewindow .r name="penguins-gt.R"}
```r
